<h3><u>Hosla Baba</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Hosla Baba</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">(Main Kaisay Doongi Yatimou'n Ko Hosla Baba) x2</font></p><font size=""4"">
<ol><li>Bujha Rahi Hai Diyay Shaam Ki Hawa Baba(a.s.)</li><p>(Main Kaisay Doongi Yatimou'n Ko Hosla Baba) x2</p><li>Tumhara Saamna Kaisay Karay Haya Meri</li><p>Udo Nay Cheenli Baba(a.s.) Abhi Rida Meri</p><p>Hamari Mushkilein Tum Hi Karo Kusha Baba(a.s.)</p><p>(Main Kaisay Doongi Yatimou'n Ko Hosla Baba) x2</p><li>Jaltay Khaimon Ka Dhuwan Daikh Rahay Ho Baba(a.s.)</li><p>Ashk Aankhon Say Rawan Daikh Rahay Ho Baba(a.s.)</p><p>Guzar Gaya Meray Kunbay Peh Saneha Baba(a.s.)</p><p>(Main Kaisay Doongi Yatimou'n Ko Hosla Baba) x2</p><li>Tamam Din Woh Manazir Nazar Nay Daikhay Hain</li><p>Woh Daikho Ganj-e-Shahidaan Mien Kitnay Lashay Hai</p><p>Uthakay Lashay Mera Bhai(a.s.) Thak Gaya Baba(a.s.)</p><p>(Main Kaisay Doongi Yatimou'n Ko Hosla Baba) x2</p><li>Meray Ghareeb(a.s.) Ko Lakhon Nay Milkay Maara Hai</li><p>Har Aik Zakhm Peh Us Nay Tumhain Pukara Hai</p><p>Baghair Dhaar Ka Khanjar Tha Aur Gala Baba(a.s.)</p><p>(Main Kaisay Doongi Yatimou'n Ko Hosla Baba) x2</p><li>Main Haath Malti Rahi Sheh(a.s.) Peh Chal Gaya Khanjar</li><p>Hai Meray Bhai(a.s.) Ka Laasha Bhi Jalti Reti Par</p><p>Kafan Bhi Bhai(a.s.) Ko Meray Nahin Mila Baba(a.s.)</p><p>(Main Kaisay Doongi Yatimou'n Ko Hosla Baba) x2</p><li>Azan Jo Di Ali Akbar(a.s.) Nay Parh Kay Bismillah</li><p>Tarhap Tarhap Kay Main Roi Hoon Subhey Ashura</p><p>Main Jaanti Thi Bicharhta Hai Mehlaqa Baba(a.s.)</p><p>(Main Kaisay Doongi Yatimou'n Ko Hosla Baba) x2</p><li>Janaza Amman Ka Shab Mein Uthaya Tha Tum Nay</li><p>Main Roi Thi To Galay Say Lagaya Tha Tum Nay</p><p>Tumhari Beti(s.a.) Hai Maqtal Mein Be Rida Baba(a.s.)</p><p>(Main Kaisay Doongi Yatimou'n Ko Hosla Baba) x2</p><li>Chupalo Apni Aba Mein Keh Thak Gai Hoon Main</li><p>Aseer Hokay Suey Shaam Jaarahi Hoon Main</p><p>Safar Taweel Hai Dushwaar Raasta Baba(a.s.)</p><p>(Main Kaisay Doongi Yatimou'n Ko Hosla Baba) x2</p><li>Bachakay Sholon Say Abid(a.s.) Ko Lai Hoon Baba(a.s.)</li></ol>

<p>Main Ghumzada Hoon Falak Ki Satai Hoon Baba(a.s.)</p>
<p>Kaleja Dard Say Zainab(s.a.) Ka Phat Gaya Baba(a.s.)</p>
<p>(Main Kaisay Doongi Yatimou'n Ko Hosla Baba) x2</p></font></p>
               
